SUMMARY:Saxophonist Maureen Walsh
DESCRIPTION:Classical Saxophonist Maureen Walsh returns to the Epiphany Series with a unique program\, performing her own arrangements for saxophone choir along with her own pre-recorded audio. As a celebration of the 250th anniversary of the U.S.\, she is featuring American composers such as Barber\, Copland\, and Gershwin. \n  \n 
URL:https://epiphanydc.org/event/saxophonist-maureen-walsh/
LOCATION:The Church of the Epiphany\, 1317 G St NW\, Washington\, DC\, 20005\, United States
