SUMMARY:Coalition for African Americans in the Performing Arts (CAAPA)
DESCRIPTION:“Freedom’s Song\, Freedom Day!” Celebrate Juneteenth as you join the Coalition for African Americans\nin the Performing Arts (CAAPA) by weaving together the legacy of African Americans in the Revolutionary War and the journey to emancipation. \n  \n 
